00:20:06.613 --> 00:20:20.633
This points to something I see with a lot of patience, the importance of relationships going at their own pace, couples avoiding doing something just because it's what they think they should do or because it's the next right step.
这指出了我在许多患者身上看到的一种情况，即保持关系按自己的节奏发展的重要性，情侣们要避免仅仅因为他们认为应该这样做或是因为这是顺理成章的下一步，就去做某事。

00:20:20.633 --> 00:20:27.887
Some couples are ready to get married after just a few months, some only after decades, years, some chose not to marry.
有些情侣在短短几个月后就准备结婚，有些则需要几十年、数年，还有些选择不结婚。

00:20:27.887 --> 00:20:38.921
